Dear store managers, we will conduct maintenance and update from 14:00 to 17:00 (GMT+8) on Mar.19th. Please arrange the game time and get offline in advance. Sorry for the inconvenience.
The following are the contents of this update:

-New level 37 regular formula: Armor of Blood Crow
-Increased level limit of some heroes
