-Easter activities in 2025: (3.20~4.23)
*Open the Easter town event. Participating in the event can unlock the festival exclusive drawings and heroes;
*Open the Easter Carnival activities, participating in the activities can win festival eggs and exchange for exclusive gifts;
*Easter themed decorations are open for a limited time;
*In order to protect the ancient tree, Arthur can wear 7 pieces of Easter equipment to obtain the "Cherry Tree" fashion;
*Open the Easter login activity, and you can receive luxury rewards by logging in continuously;
*Easter theme wallpaper and floor skin are open for limited time

-Recharging activity started (3.20~4.23)
Recharge any amount during the event to get the following rewards:
*288 diamonds;
*High decoration points limit the original painting: "Star Queen" Nier;
*Legendary equipment: Rejuvenation cross breastplate lucky rabbit foot lily potion

